# These links are inherited verbatim from upstream arduino/ArduinoCore-zephyr
# (main is an automatically synced mirror - see .github/workflows/sync_upstream_main.yml).
# Do not "fix" them by editing the upstream-mirrored files directly; that would
# create permanent merge conflicts on every nightly upstream sync/rebase.
# Exclude them here instead, matched against lychee's resolved file:// URI,
# so patterns are suffix-anchored (no leading ^) and not tied to one checkout path.

# README.md: GitHub-specific repo-root-relative convention for issues/pulls
# links (resolves correctly in GitHub's web UI, not on a local filesystem).
/issues$
/pulls$

# README.md: paths to tools/scripts that were relocated upstream (extra/ ->
# tools/) and a plural/singular mismatch (boards -> boards.txt, firmware ->
# firmwares); fixing these belongs in an upstream PR, not here.
/boards$
/extra/zephyr-sketch-tool$
/extra/sync-zephyr-artifacts$
/firmware$

# libraries/Camera/README.md: dead docs/ link, present upstream as well.
/libraries/Camera/docs$

# libraries/Ethernet/README.md: valid page, blocks automated/bot requests
# with 403 but works for a real browser.
http://www\.arduino\.cc/en/Reference/Ethernet

# README.md: valid support article, blocks automated/bot requests with 403
# but works for a real browser.
https://support\.arduino\.cc/hc/en-us/articles/29180434600476-Install-the-Zephyr-loader-on-your-board
